# Serving image only. Compile to requirements-serve.txt WITH HASHES, for the image's
# interpreter and platform (python 3.11, linux/amd64), not the laptop's:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#     --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 requirements-serve.in -o requirements-serve.txt
#
# No mlflow. The deployed service loads a registered version through the adapter
# (MODEL_URI, resolved from the registry at deploy time), never through MLflow, and
# mlflow roughly triples the image — which is cold-start time on a scale-to-zero service.
